Guidelines for Reviewers L39:       * cite32†Accepted Manuscripts L40:       * cite33†Comments L41:   * About\nL42:     * cite34†Journal Information L43:     * cite35†Editors-in-Chief L44:     * cite36†Editorial Board L45:     * cite37†Publishing Information L46:     * cite38†Publication Fees†plos.org L47:     * cite39†Press and Media†plos.org L48:     * cite40†Contact L49:   * Search Search\nL50: \nL51: [Input: SEARCH]\nL52: \nL53: [Input]\nL54: \nL55: cite41†advanced search L56: \nL57:   * Loading metrics\nL58: \nL59: Open Access\nL60: \nL61: Peer-reviewed\nL62: \nL63: Research Article\nL64: # Quantitative Genome-Wide Genetic Interaction Screens Reveal Global Epistatic Relationships of Protein Complexes in Escherichia coli\nL65: \nL66:   * Mohan Babu ,\nL67: \nL68: Contributed equally to this work with: Mohan Babu, Roland Arnold, Cedoljub Bundalovic-Torma, Alla Gagarinova, Keith S. Wong\nL69: \nL70: * E-mail: mohan.babu@uregina.ca (MB); andrew.emili@utoronto.ca (AE)\nL71: Affiliations Banting and Best Department of Medical Research, Donnelly Centre, University of Toronto, Toronto, Ontario, Canada, Department of Biochemistry, Research and Innovation Centre, University of Regina, Regina, Saskatchewan, Canada\nL72: \nL73:   * Roland Arnold ,\nL74: \nL75: Contributed equally to this work with: Mohan Babu, Roland Arnold, Cedoljub Bundalovic-Torma, Alla Gagarinova, Keith S. Wong\nL76: Affiliation Banting and Best Department of Medical Research, Donnelly Centre, University of Toronto, Toronto, Ontario, Canada\nL77: \nL78:   * Cedoljub Bundalovic-Torma ,\nL79: \nL80: Contributed equally to this work with: Mohan Babu, Roland Arnold, Cedoljub Bundalovic-Torma, Alla Gagarinova, Keith S. Wong\nL81: \nL82: Affiliations Hospital for Sick Children, Toronto, Ontario, Canada, Department of Biochemistry, University of Toronto, Toronto, Ontario, Canada\nL83: \nL84:   * Alla Gagarinova ,\nL85: Contributed equally to this work with: Mohan Babu, Roland Ar